{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51236","headline":"偈 · 慧能","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（慧能不识字，闻人诵神秀偈，乃偈请人书其侧曰：）菩提本无树，明镜亦非台。\n本来无一物，何处惹尘埃？\n（同上。\n）（此偈最早见於法海本《六祖法宝坛经》。\n敦煌本引作二首，文字差异较大，另详《全唐诗续拾》卷九。\n）（今按：禅宗六祖南北二家之偈，实爲明白如话的哲理诗，最有代表性，故特补录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}